                <head>550. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On May 17, Ambassador Johnson delivered an address at Wayne State University in
                    Detroit on the subject of U.S.-Thai cooperation; for text, see Department of
                    State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, June 20, 1960, pages 1001–1006.</p>
            </div>
